/span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>100706</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>药理学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>1007J1</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>动物药学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>1007Z6</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>药物代谢动力学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span><span><span><span>105500</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>01</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>药物合成与工艺优化</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>02</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>工业药剂学</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>03</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>药物质量控制</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>04</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>新药临床前评价</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>05</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>禁毒技术与毒物鉴定</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>06</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>成药性评价技术与工程</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><br/></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年药学院接收直博生专业目录：</span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>专业</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>代码</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>药物化学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>100701</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>药剂学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>100702</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>药物分析学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>100704</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>药理学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>100706</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>药物代谢动力学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>1007Z6</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>动物药学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>1007J1</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span>备注：各专业实际推免招生计划数以“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”数据为准。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>、具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>、全国高校</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生，所学专业为药学类、中药学类、化学类、生物科学类、化工与制药类、生物医学工程类、生物工程类、食品科学与工程类、管理学类等相关专业，且预计可获得所在高校免试推荐资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>、身体健康状况符合教育部等部门制定的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>、学习成绩优异，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力，具有相应研究生培养潜质。在校期间曾参加科学研究、全国学术竞赛等活动表现突出者，及具有代表性科研成果者优先考虑。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>、申报直博生的考生，截至目前总评成绩应在本科推免环节排名前</span></span><span><span>8%</span></span><span><span>（含</span></span><span><span>8%</span></span><span><span>）；各类国家级基地班的学生截至目前总评成绩应在本科推免环节排名前</span></span><span><span>50%</span></span><span><span>（含</span></span><span><span>50%</span></span><span><span>），入选“药学拔尖创新人才培养计划”不做排名要求。</span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>、具有良好的英语水平，</span></span><span><span>CET-6</span></span><span><span>成绩合格或达到六级相应水平。</span></span></p><p><span><span>其中申报直博生的考生，要求六级（</span></span><span><span>CET-6</span></span><span><span>）成绩≥</span></span><span><span>450</span></span><span><span>分；或托福（</span></span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span><span><span>）成绩≥</span></span><span><span>90</span></span><span><span>分；或雅思（</span></span><span><span>IELTS</span></span><span><span>）成绩≥</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>；或以第一作者（排位第一）在</span></span><span><span>SCI</span></span><span><span>期刊（不含扩展版）上发表过一篇专业学术研究论文（成绩有效期均在</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>年之内）。  </span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>、中国药科大学“本</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>博贯通班”在读学生的本科推免环节排名及英语水平要求按照学校面向该专业制定的相关文件执行。</span></span></p><p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>、申请人可以综合考虑各学院推免生预报名工作安排，合理自愿填报多个学院，但同一个学院内限填报</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>个硕士志愿。直博生申请人仅限填报</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>个直博生志愿，并可同时填报硕士志愿。申请人若跨</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>个及以上学院填报志愿，需要再次注册账号。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>    三、申请材料</span></span></span></p><p><span>1</span><span>、身份证或在读学生证（必填）；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>、由所在学校院系的教务部门开具的本科学习成绩单（必填）；</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>、本科推荐环节成绩排名情况（必填）；</span></p><p><span>4</span><span>、外语水平证明，如</span><span>CET-4</span><span>、</span><span>CET-6</span><span>、雅思、托福、专业英语等（必填）；</span></p><p><span>5</span><span>、学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）（选填）；</span></p><p><span>6</span><span>、获得各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书（选填）；</span></p><p><a href=\"https://yxy.cpu.edu.cn/70/cb/c11892a225483/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>7</span><span>、专家推荐书（暂不必填）：申请直博生者提供至少</span><span>2</span><span>份《专家推荐书》（可在预报名系统中生成下载模板），由所报考学科专业领域内的正高级教授（或相当专业技术职称的专家）撰写的书面推荐意见（推免硕士生是否提交《专家推荐书》不做硬性要求）。</span></p><p><span><span>四、</span></span><span>申请程序</span></p><p><span><span><span>报考</span><span><span>药学院</span></span><span>的考生，系统报名时间</span></span></span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span><span>8</span></span><span>日</span><span>15</span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span>至</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span><span>15</span></span><span>日</span><span>15</span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span>。报名学生请在规定时间段内，登录我校推免生预报名系统（</span><span>http://yzs.cpu.edu.cn/logon</span><span>）</span><span>,</span><span>如实填写各项信息并提交材料。报名项目选择“推免生预报名”。系统账户考生需自行注册使用，注册时须填写个人真实有效信息。</span></p><p><span><span><span>之后</span><span><span>学院</span></span><span>会对报名学生进行资格审核，</span></span></span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span><span>24</span></span><span>日前向符合条件、入围的学生在系统中发送通知，未收到通知者即未入选，不再另行通知。收到通知学生请在接到通知后</span><span>4</span><span>小时内登陆系统确认。</span></p><p><span><span>五、</span></span><span><span>考核时间</span>地点安排</span></p><p><span><span><span>政策宣讲及导师介绍：</span><span><span>暂定</span></span></span></span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span><span>29</span></span><span>日上午</span><span>9:30-1</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span><span><span>，</span><span><span>地点待定</span></span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>专业面试考核、导师交流及实验室参观等活动：</span><span><span>暂定</span></span></span></span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>29</span><span><span><span>日下午起，具体时间由各</span><span><span>学科</span></span><span>单独通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>上述考核时间地点安排如有变化会在</span><span><span>药学院</span></span><span>网站挂出，请报名学生及时关注网站通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span>六、政审表邮寄要求</span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>《中国药科大学考生思想政治表现、自然情况审查表》</span></span><span><span>请在我校研究生招生信息网下载专区下载打印</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>盖章版原件</span></span><span>务必于</span><span>10</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>15</span><span>日前邮寄至药学院。</span></p><p><span>邮寄信息：江苏省南京市江宁区龙眠大道</span><span><span>639</span><span>号中国药科大学药学院综合实验楼G</span><span><font><span>506</span></font></span></span><span><span>办公室，高老师，</span></span><span>025-861</span><span>85301</span><span><span><span>。</span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>只能</span></span><span><span><span>使用</span></span></span><span><span>邮政EMS或者顺丰快递，不可使用其他快递；面单上详细标明“政审表”！）</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span>请通过预报名系统审核，并确认参加面试的同学于8月26日（周二）上午12:00前加入对应学科复试联络群：</span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>（1）药物化学（学硕）、药物合成与工艺优化（专硕）、成药性评价技术与工程（专硕）QQ群：</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>群号947731063</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>（2）药剂学（学硕）、工业药剂学（专硕）：</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span><strong><span>药剂学硕qq1群：677453449</span></strong></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span><strong><span>药剂学硕qq2群+专硕群：635987170</span></strong></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>药剂1群已加满的学硕同学，请加2群<br/></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>（3）药物分析学（学硕）、动物药学（学硕）、禁毒技术与毒物鉴定（专硕）、药物质量控制（专硕）</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span><strong><span>QQ群号：</span></strong>852873125（TIM）</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://yxy.cpu.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/7d/ed/6b91b6e74326a95bd138fefce0aa/f69b1881-4092-4f41-b2ae-f1efaf7c50c7.jpg\"/></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span><strong><span>（4）<strong><span>药理学（学硕）、药物代谢动力学（学硕）、新药临床前评价（专硕）：</span></strong></span></strong></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>qq群号：1060566213</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>六</span></span></span><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span><span>025-86185301</span></span></p><p><span><span>院部网站：</span></span><span><span>http://yxy.cpu.edu.cn/</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>七</span></span></span><span><span>、本实施方案的解释权归中国药科大学</span></span><span><span><span>药学院</span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>中国药科大学药学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>                                      2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"1dcdf3ce34302dbffecaff97a621f6bd08f71b69daec766b714b4a3944cd85d9","textLength":2387,"sourceSha256":"d0b8bb465cccff4b9b30f67f8176a16ecde3f26a0cbc0e2e6d230871dcab31e5","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-053ed1a91ec986b36d1a","title":"2025年中国药科大学药学院2026年接收推免生（含直博生） 预报名工作方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:55.846999+00:00"}
